{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the equation of the unit circle: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/9450293d1b63662aef95978423601074264f51b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + y^{2} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/692545ddeefbdf7f006f3aa196d642d8020ac7a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"26\" height=\"39\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6fdef88155edbb891ca512745fc4553a4289fc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = 1  \\quad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = \\dfrac{y}{x}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = -\\dfrac{x}{y}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = -\\dfrac{y}{x}  \\quad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = \\dfrac{x}{y}  \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"591\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the derivative with respect to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8aff255eeeca3dce38ca9257b3bcb9947869258d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 2y \\times \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b039a7cd826d44d22d70557c8f68542488b2220b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y \\times \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = -2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556f1dce063ed47a8f1546b786eb758cd20ad926.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{-2x}{2y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"88\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b4157d6c2a65f2f2c525b18a51001620c94b6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{dy}{dx} = -\\dfrac{x}{y}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"124\" height=\"54\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2025 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High